msgstr "Ku biir fasalkaaga"

msgid "Enter your class code and pick a display name."
msgstr "Geli koodhka fasalkaaga oo dooro magac muuqda."

msgid "Enter the class code from your teacher. Pick any display name you like."
msgstr "Geli koodhka fasalka ee macallinkaaga. Dooro magac muuqda oo aad jeceshahay."

